@startuml
actor User
participant Gateway
participant CatalogService
participant OfferEngine
participant OrderService
participant WalletService
participant ProviderPlugin
participant EventBus

== Fetch Offers ==

User -> Gateway: Get Offers
Gateway -> CatalogService: Request Offers

CatalogService -> OfferEngine: Build Offers
OfferEngine --> CatalogService: Offers List

CatalogService --> Gateway: Offers List
Gateway --> User: Show Offers

== User Selection ==

User -> Gateway: Select Offer

== Order Execution ==

Gateway -> OrderService: Create Order (offer_id)

OrderService -> WalletService: Reserve Balance
WalletService --> OrderService: Reserved

OrderService -> ProviderPlugin: Execute Offer
ProviderPlugin --> OrderService: Result

OrderService -> EventBus: Publish OfferExecuted
@enduml